>Assertion failed: hunk, file ../patch-2.5.9-src/patch.c, line 354

Looks like the patch program itself is failing. What patch program are you
using, and what version? Perhaps your MinGW or Cygwin installation needs an
upgrade.

It might help to know what "patch --version" says, and which patches in
particular give this problem; also, what parts of the offending patch apply
before the program bombs.

Something else to try: break the patch up into smaller parts, beginning at each
line that begins with "diff"; this gives a set of patches, each applying to one
source file. When you get one that bombs, you can try editing that source file
by hand.

